    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling adventure with &quot;EscapeGameShow: THE TIMELINE&quot;, an innovative escape room game that transports you through different eras of history. Designed for puzzle and riddle lovers, this game offers an immersive and challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various historical eras, each era presenting its own unique challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ingenious puzzles that will test your logic, creativity, and problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility: Designed to be accessible to all levels of players, with built-in tutorials and hints to help beginners while providing sufficient challenges for experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards and Achievements: Earn trophies and rewards by solving puzzles and progressing through the story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a thrilling adventure with &quot;EscapeGameShow: THE TIMELINE&quot;, an innovative escape room game that transports you through different eras of history. Designed for puzzle and riddle lovers, this game offers an immersive and challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various historical eras, each era presenting its own unique challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ingenious puzzles that will test your logic, creativity, and problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility: Designed to be accessible to all levels of players, with built-in tutorials and hints to help beginners while providing sufficient challenges for experts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards and Achievements: Earn trophies and rewards by solving puzzles and progressing through the story.</p>",
